	{ title = "Elanaria", note = "At 10, Kyra Windblade, the warrior trainer in Dolanaar, or Moon Priestess Amara, who patrols the road west of Dolanaar, sends you to Elanaria on the Warrior's Terrace in Darnassus. Any Alliance warrior may take one of the three roads, never two: in Stormwind at 10 anyway? Ilsa Corbin's A Warrior's Training teaches the same stance after one fight in a tavern.", only = { races = {"NightElf"} }, goals = {
