	{ title = "Morgan's Vigil: Dragonkin Menace", note = "Helendis Riverhorn at Morgan's Vigil, in the south-east of the Burning Steppes, starts The True Masters: 175 Darnassus reputation for two quests (level 54: in Classic 140 at 60), and the chain goes on to Stormwind Keep for 175 Stormwind. The Black Broodlings and the Black Drake live on the slopes north of the Vigil; the Black Dragonspawn and Black Wyrmkin west of it, in the middle of the zone.", goals = {
		{ t = "level", level = 55 },
