	{ title = "Around Brill", note = "Use the Executor's Motivator on five Deathguards around Brill. For Patience, talk to Deathguard Dillinger west of Brill, Deathguard Kristof at the waystation east of it and Gordo on the road. The Rot Hide gnolls dig at the mass grave north of Brill. The Rotting Dead walk around the old bridge west of Brill; the dry branches lie under the trees there. Darkhounds roam everywhere.", when = {{ k = "done", label = "brill" }}, goals = {
