	{ title = "Additional Runecloth to Exalted", note = "Revered to Exalted is 21,000: 420 hand-ins, 8,400 Runecloth. For The Horde! (Rend's head) and The Lord of Blackrock (Nefarian's head) pay 200 to every Horde city. At Exalted, Zachariah Post in Brill sells the skeletal horses to every Horde race: 20 gold for a level 40 horse, 200 gold for a level 60 warhorse (Forever's prices); in Classic other races needed Exalted to buy them.", goals = {
