	{ title = "The Moonkin Stone", note = "The Moonkin Stone stands in the Barrens just south-west of Camp Taurajo, by the road out of Mulgore. Level 20 Thunderheads roam close by: clear the way first. Use the Cenarion Lunardust by the stone: Lunaclaw (level 12-13) appears for three minutes. Kill her, then speak to the Lunaclaw Spirit that appears and ask for the strength of her body and heart: the talk is the credit. Die in the fight? Lunaclaw stays by the stone: run back and finish her.", only = { races = {"Tauren"} }, goals = {
