	{ title = "Urs'endris and Ur'endra", note = "Urs'endris waits by the waterfall below the Shrine of Akir, north-east of Valanaar. Ur'endra (the bear you must defeat) lairs in an unmarked cave high on the cliff face west of him, where the Shen'dar Highlands meet the Gustberry Lowlands: take the path west out of Valanaar (not north), cross the river on the log bridge and reach the cave from the cliff's upper, northern side. The cave at the foot of the cliffs and the foggy cave are the wrong ones.", only = { races = {"Skyborne"} }, goals = {
