	{ title = "The Sunken Temple", note = "The Sunken Temple (Temple of Atal'Hakkar, level 50-56, a group of five) stands in the middle of the Pool of Tears: swim down into the temple and take the stairs to the entrance. The six troll guardians (level 51-52, elite) stand on the balconies around the central pit, each with adds; each drops his feather every time: Gasher and Zul'Lor the Amber, Hukku and Mijan the Blue, Zolo and Loro the Green. Not soloable at 52.", goals = {
