	{ title = "Elixir of Greater Defense to 300", note = "Elixir of Greater Defense is orange at 265 (yellow 280, green 300, grey 320): about 43 crafts to 300. Each takes 2 Stonescale Oil, 1 Sungrass and 1 Crystal Vial. Make the 86 Stonescale Oil (43 crafts) first. Stonescale Eel comes from the Stonescale Eel schools on the coasts of the 40-55 zones, or the Auction House (fishers sell them in stacks). Sungrass grows in the 40-55 zones. Alchemy 300 is a Legacy System milestone.", section = 4, goals = {
