	{ title = "Rough Blasting Powder to 35", note = "Rough Blasting Powder is orange at 1 (yellow 20, green 30, grey 40): about 46 crafts to 35. Each takes 1 Rough Stone. One Rough Stone a craft; Rough Stone comes with the Copper Ore from Copper Veins.", section = 1, goals = {
