	{ title = "Copper Tube to 75", note = "Copper Tube is orange at 57 (yellow 80, green 95, grey 110): about 18 crafts to 75, a point every craft. Each takes 2 Copper Bar and 1 Weak Flux. Two Copper Bars and a Weak Flux a craft (blacksmithing and engineering suppliers). Needs an anvil nearby. Make the Arclight Spanner now, while it still gives a point: a later recipe needs it in your bags, so keep it there.", section = 1, goals = {
