		{ t = "skill", level = 75, skillName = "Engineering" },
	} },
	{ title = "Journeyman Engineering", note = "Journeyman raises the cap from 75 to 150 for 5s (Classic's price; Forever's is not in the data); it needs Engineering 50 and character level 10, so you can take it on any visit from 50. Not every Engineering trainer teaches it: Alliance Finbus Geargrind (Duskwood), Lilliam Sparkspindle (Stormwind City) and Trixie Quikswitch (Ironforge); Horde Franklin Lloyd (Undercity) and Nogg (Orgrimmar). The arrow picks the nearest of your faction. Learn now: Coarse Blasting Powder (from 75, 2s 50c) and Crafted Heavy Shot (from 75, 2s 50c). 75-150 takes about 5s of recipes and 45s of vendor goods, plus 15 Coarse Stone, 27 Heavy Stone, 72 Copper Bar, 61 Bronze Bar and 2 Silver Bar to gather or buy.", section = 2, goals = {
