	{ title = "Fishing: Wetlands (125-225)", note = "Fish the pools here until skill 225, about 500 catches: one in three raises the skill at 125, one in seven by 225, so this is the long stretch. Forever's second camping item, the Fishing Rack (from skill 140), is a blueprint that drops from Gelihast in Blackfathom Deeps. Fish get away here below skill 150; a lure on the pole adds to your skill for ten minutes and closes the gap.", only = { races = {"Human", "Dwarf", "Gnome", "Skyborne"}, factions = {"Alliance"} }, section = 3, goals = {
