	{ title = "Guardian Gloves to 180", note = "Guardian Gloves is orange at 165 (yellow 185, green 195, grey 205): about 15 crafts to 180, a point every craft. Each takes 4 Heavy Leather, 1 Cured Heavy Hide and 1 Silken Thread. Make the 15 Cured Heavy Hide first. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data.", section = 3, goals = {
