	{ title = "Nightscape Pants to 225", note = "Nightscape Pants is orange at 213 (yellow 225, green 235, grey 245): about 12 crafts to 225, a point every craft. Each takes 14 Thick Leather and 4 Silken Thread. The trainer teaches it, and it is the cheapest way through these points in the data. Leatherworking 225 is a Legacy System milestone.", section = 3, goals = {
