	{ title = "Back at the gate", note = "Your first Alterac Valley Marks of Honor go to the Alliance Brigadier General beside Lieutenant Haggerdin: 150 the first time (Remember Alterac Valley!), then 100 for every 3 more. Forever's PvP gear also costs Marks of Honor along with honor: decide what you want before you hand them in. You can carry at most 30 Alterac Valley marks: hand in or spend them before you reach that.", only = { factions = {"Alliance"} }, goals = {
