	} },
	{ title = "Rise and Be Recognized", note = "Friendly lets Lieutenant Haggerdin upgrade your insignia: 100 reputation. Friendly to Honored is 6000 reputation. In Classic a full win paid 300 to 700 with its 3 marks; the Brigadier General keeps taking 3 marks for 100. Inside, Master Ryson's All Seeing Eye (75, from the Winterax caves) repeats every game; Korrak the Bloodrager (200, when he appears in the middle of the valley) goes back to Lieutenant Haggerdin here. Friendly opens the Stormpike Battle Tabard (1g) and the Superior Healing and Mana Draughts (5s) at Thanthaldis Snowgleam beside him.", only = { factions = {"Alliance"} }, goals = {
