		{ t = "rep", factionName = "Cenarion Circle", faction = 609, standing = 8 },
	} },
	{ title = "The Ruins of Ahn'Qiraj, when they open", note = "A 20-player raid behind the Scarab Wall in the far south-west of Silithus. A full clear is about 1,600 Cenarion reputation: the trash 3 each until 20,999 of 21,000 Revered, Kurinnaxx, Moam, Buru and Ayamiss 150 each and Ossirian 300, to Exalted. Ossirian's head starts The Fall of Ossirian (200 here and 200 Brood of Nozdormu). Their drops buy the ring (Honored), cloak (Revered) and weapon (Exalted) quests of Windcaller Yessendra, Keyl Swiftclaw and Warden Haro in the Hold, 100 reputation each. Dirk Thunderwood in the Hold pays 100 once for The Perfect Poison: Kurinnaxx's Venom Sac from here and Venoxis's from Zul'Gurub. Lieutenant General Andorov sells Plans: Jagged Obsidian Shield (Revered, 5g) and Obsidian Mail Tunic (Exalted, 8g) inside.", goals = {
