	{ title = "Theramore Expeditionary Force to Friendly", note = "Neutral to Friendly is 3000 reputation. Forever has not said how much a game pays by itself; the sure part is the Brigadier General's 100 for every 3 marks, which is one win, so at most 30 wins from Neutral even before the games' own reputation. Each new bracket (40, 50, 60) brings a new first win for Brelinda McFarry (200) and a new first mark quest (150).", only = { factions = {"Alliance"} }, goals = {
